                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d9d5ed4e-f1af-4ad4-a3bc-29a30e6e89ec",
                                "sense_id": "c8b3a3c1-3323-3678-b4d6-2468e5ce877c",
                                "text": "Another threat to the use of IM is a phenomenon known as spimming. Spimming is to IM as spam is to e-mail. Some aggressive spimmers learned how to take over one IMer's contact list — threatening a company's entire IM system!"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a28ffa3a-8bb1-3057-892c-5c27f88946a3",
                        "entry_id": "c2a9062f-d0a1-301c-8c27-96dd19182fb6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A swimmer who competes in the individual medley race."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fc89a94f-9a4d-4a24-b625-6dce79e4f2da",
                                "sense_id": "a28ffa3a-8bb1-3057-892c-5c27f88946a3",
                                "text": "\"When I first joined ACAC (Ames Cyclones Aquatics Club), we were swimming together in a lane and I ended up going behind her,\" Hala said. \"We were doing IM (individual medley) in warm-up and I was on her feet and I was like I'm an IMer, can I go ahead of you? She told me no.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "96f97bc1-7009-490d-a220-c1607dbc4013",
                                "sense_id": "a28ffa3a-8bb1-3057-892c-5c27f88946a3",
                                "text": "\"Jipping had himself a meet,\" Scheerhorn said. \"He used to be an IMer and backstroker. This season, we knew we needed someone else in the 200 free and seeing that five-second drop in prelims was incredible. He swam lights out.\""
                            }
